## Global contact plan for CBR Phase 6 - 3-node custody transfer test
##
## Topology: Node 1 (source) -> Node 2 (intermediate custodian) -> Node 3 (destination)
##
## This test verifies multi-hop custody transfer:
##   1. Node 1 sends bundle with custody requested to Node 3
##   2. Node 2 accepts custody and sends CCS back to Node 1
##   3. Node 2 forwards bundle to Node 3
##   4. Node 3 accepts custody and sends CCS back to Node 2
##
## All nodes support CBR/CT (compressed bundle reporting and custody transfer)

m horizon +0

## Ranges (OWLT = 1 second between adjacent nodes)
a range +0 +600 1 2 1
a range +0 +600 2 1 1
a range +0 +600 2 3 1
a range +0 +600 3 2 1

## Contacts: Node 1 <-> Node 2
a contact +5 +600 1 2 100000
a contact +5 +600 2 1 100000

## Contacts: Node 2 <-> Node 3
a contact +5 +600 2 3 100000
a contact +5 +600 3 2 100000
